      ],
      "assessment": "Plan 1 pays scheduled hospital cash; Plan 5 indemnifies hospital expenses; Plan 6 indemnifies excess over aggregate limit; Plan 8 includes outpatient expenses with schedule-selected coverage. Medical-expense scope is justified with mixed fixed/service components explicitly retained. No whole-product fixed-benefit or automatic all-plan coverage assertion."
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL-R13-02",
      "topic": "Personal Accident Shield medical-expense component",
      "status": "supported",
      "sources": [
