          "physical_pages": [
            2,
            4,
            5
          ]
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "Fixed death/disability compensation coexists with medical-expense benefits. Optional comprehensive medical-expense extension on p5 is individual-only, premium-dependent and accident/grievous-injury triggered. Classification does not imply general illness or automatic floater coverage."
    },
