      "assessment": "Companion, Consumables and Smart Outpatient each define Base Policy as any individual Galaxy health policy to which the rider is attached. Unlimited Automatic Restoration explicitly names Galaxy Promise Elite Plan. Definitions do not establish actual purchased attachment. Restoration p2 retains inception/renewal purchase, schedule opt-in, migration availability and base-policy dependencies."
