      "assessment": "P24 notes trigger insurer liability only when admissible aggregate hospitalization expenses in the policy period exceed the deductible. P25 note3 expressly excludes pre/post-hospitalization from accumulation. The p24 table nevertheless marks those benefits part of SI. The report correctly separates expense eligibility for accumulation from benefit inclusion. No complete payout calculation is claimed."
